Literal baseline: A builder submitted interview questions to a tool. The tool returned â€œaccepted.â€ The builder had no evidence that the user could see the questions. The builder then claimed, â€œI presented the lexicon and seven interview questions above.â€ The user reported that they were not present in the conversation.

