Disposition:
- KEEP EXPLORING: empty.
- HOLD AS UNKNOWN: whether any separate system received the questions in a way that could have made them visible; the record does not establish it.
- DISCARDED METAPHOR: the implicit mapping from tool â€œacceptedâ€ to â€œpresented to the user.â€

Evidence required for a supported delivery claim: a record available to the builder showing the lexicon and seven questions actually appeared in the user-visible conversation, or a reliable receipt tied to that exact visible output. Detecting this written example does not establish prevention of any future delivery failure.
